DESCRIPTION:Ready to kick up your boots and hit the dance floor?⁠ ⁠ Jo
 in us on First Fridays\, July 3\, for a night of line dancing lessons and 
 open dance. Whether you're a seasoned dancer or stepping onto the floor fo
 r the first time\, they'll guide you through every move. ⁠ ⏰ Doors are
  at 6:30\, and dancing will go until 10! 👢 Lessons and DJ by Grapevine 
 Dance 🎟️ $20 admission—cash or card at the door. 🕺 Kids 12 and u
 nder free. All skill levels welcome\, no partner required. 🍹 We’ll ha
 ve a cash bar with cocktails\, mocktails\, and other beverages! 🤠 And t
 o really get you in the country mood\, we’ll have a hat bar via Mad Chic
 ks Hat Bar See you on the dance floor! #block-b57ad316c8ca8155ab1d { --str
