 t-Hall-of-the-Above.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Our regularly-scheduled dances will be taking a break for the 
 summer! We started the dances as a way to open up the building to the comm
 unity on a more frequent basis\, but it’s been hard to keep them up\, as
  we must pay our staff\, the teacher\, and the band for each one\, and do 
 not always have the attendance to make this feasible. Thank you to everyon
 e that has attended the dances so far—we love to see everyone dancing to
 gether! —The team at Hall of the Above #block-54497498e80d5628520d { --s
 troke-style: none\;--stroke-thickness: 6px\; --tweak-text-block-background
